  <document-link format="APPLICATION/PDF" url="https://aidstream.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/documents/Case-about-SRHR-and-Climate-Change-20240628010650.pdf">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion of sexual and reproductive health and rights (SRHR) into climate change policy</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2023, the County Assembly of Kilifi County approved the Kilifi Climate Change policy. Although the nexus between climate change and SRHR is not recognised in the policy, it does include significant policies concerning health, women, and youth. These amongst others include: &#x201c;Climate-proof new investments in the water, sanitation, and health sectors&#x201d; and &#x201c;Undertake a gender-sensitive analysis of climate change impacts to identify the specific challenges faced by women, youth&#x201d;. These are important steppingstones towards inclusion of SRHR and gender.</narrative>
   </description>
